<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>KHajistan Express 🚂</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd6e7, #ffe9b8);
      padding: 25px 0;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 35px 25px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      width: 85%;
      max-width: 650px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .clue {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }

    .mission {
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .video {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      height: 315px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">

    <h1>🚂 KHajistan Express</h1>

    <div class="clue">
      <p>
        Your next clue is not in the sky,<br>
        And definitely not where birds fly.
      </p>

      <p>
        You’ve got a car, you’ve got the keys,<br>
        Now search around — but take it with ease.
      </p>

      <p>
        Something is waiting, that much is true…
      </p>

      <p class="mission">
        Your next mission: find what’s hiding from you. 😈🎁
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="video">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2czL_j16P1A"
        title="Birthday Surprise"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
